{"candidateAnswer":"A shadow box display featuring postcards and small souvenirs from her visit to the English countryside.","evidence":"[D8:15 | 6:03 pm on 6 March, 2023] Maria: Thanks, John! I got the idea from that trip to England a few years ago - I was mesmerized by the castles. I wanted to bring that same magic to my home, like a reminder of the world's beauty. I made a painting too!","itemId":"urn:uuid:0bbab530-8ef0-5082-9542-d36e38550c20","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:bd3b61aaf480519a28fab336ed2833cd44d4062186e569afd7100e400735237d","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What did Maria make for her home to remind her of a trip to England?","referenceAnswer":"painting of a castle on a hill","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"bd3b61aaf480519a28fab336ed2833cd44d4062186e569afd7100e400735237d"}}]}